# mtplx-telemetry-watch
owner: turbosovth · cadence: every 2h during active use · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that samples MTPLX `/metrics` and `/health` during live Hermes loads and flags prefill admission shed or pressure trim events?**

## Prompt
Query MTPLX health and metrics; if prefill_admission_shed or pressure_trim events appear in the last period, append a dated note to wiki/entities/mtplx-memory-guard.md and notify if rate rises.

## Evidence
> MTPLX emits `prefill_admission_shed` memory-guard events that clear KV cache to keep projected bytes under threshold
> [mtplx] memory pressure guard {"action": "pressure_trim"...}
